<p>
    Planning a website is an important first step in web development. It involves 
    identifying the purpose of the site, understanding the target audience, 
    organizing content, and designing a layout that provides a positive user experience.
</p>

<p>
    In Chapter 1, I learned the basics of creating a webpage, including 
    structuring HTML with essential elements like <code>html</code>, 
    <code>head</code>, <code>title</code>, <code>meta</code>, and <code>body</code>. 
    This foundation is crucial for building and planning more advanced websites.
